<div class="space-y-4">
  <div class="gw-window gw-frame p-6 leading-relaxed">
    <%= render 'documentation/breadcrumb', page: 'Build Commands' %>

    <h1 class="font-display text-gold-300 text-2xl tracking-wide m-0 mt-3">Build Commands</h1>
    <p class="text-muted mt-1 mb-0">Show Guild Wars builds from template codes</p>

    <div class="flex gap-6 mt-6">
      <%= render 'documentation/sidebar' %>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 gw-doc">
        <h2>Command Reference</h2>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/build</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Show a build from a GW1 template code</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/build &lt;code&gt; [--verbose]</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Parameters:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li><code>code</code> (required): The template code from the in-game Templates panel</li>
            <li><code>verbose</code> (optional): Show skill names and descriptions</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Example:</strong> <code>/build OAQhYgB3Kg7H0b2H3I4H5</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> Embed with build image showing skills, attributes, and profession</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Verbose Example:</strong> <code>/build OAQhYgB3Kg7H0b2H3I4H5 --verbose true</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Verbose Response:</strong> Embed with additional skill descriptions and attribute details</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <h2>How to Get a Template Code</h2>
          <ol>
            <li>Copy the Template Code from the Skills Template window</li>
            <li>Paste the code in Discord with <code>/build &lt;code&gt;</code></li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <h2>Related Commands</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><%= link_to '/teambuild', teambuild_doc_path %> - For team builds (pawned2 format)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
